Package: {{ package_name }}
Version: {{ package_version }}
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Imbue <support@imbue.com>
Depends: {{ debian_dependencies | join(', ') }}
Description: VPS-resident latchkey gateway for remote mngr hosts
 Runs the latchkey gateway (pinned to latchkey {{ latchkey_version }}) on the
 machine's docker bridge address, and the reverse SSH tunnel into an agent's
 container that predates that route, as supervisord programs; keeps the
 gateway's port (and the owner-exec daemon's) on that bridge with an nftables
 policy; and provides the two commands the user's computer drives the machine
 through: "mngr-latchkey read-state" and "mngr-latchkey apply-state".
